{"unit":4,"items":21,"pass":15,"title":"Unit Test · Unit 4","html":"\n  <section class=\"stage on\" data-stage=\"Unit Test\">\n    <div class=\"stage-head\">\n      <div class=\"kicker\">Unit 4 &middot; Unit Test</div>\n      <h2>Places</h2>\n      <p>Twenty-one questions on Lessons 13&ndash;16: there is/are, articles, directions, instructions. Answer them all, then press Check. You need <b>15 out of 21</b> to pass &mdash; and you can take this test as many times as you like.</p>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"task\" data-task data-tid=\"review-u4\">\n\n      <div class=\"instruction\">Part 1 &middot; Grammar and vocabulary &nbsp;<span class=\"qcount\">questions 1&ndash;15</span></div>\n\n      <p class=\"subline\">Choose the correct answer.</p>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">1</span><span class=\"body\">___ two cafés on my street.\n        <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"c\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">It is</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">There is</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"c\">There are</button></div></span></div>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">2</span><span class=\"body\">___ a park near here?\n        <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"b\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">Are there</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">Is there</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"c\">There is</button></div></span></div>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">3</span><span class=\"body\">There aren't ___ shops here.\n        <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"a\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">any</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">a</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"c\">some</button></div></span></div>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">4</span><span class=\"body\">I live in ___ flat.\n        <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"b\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">the</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">a</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"c\">an</button></div></span></div>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">5</span><span class=\"body\">___ flat is small but bright. (we know which)\n        <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"b\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">An</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">The</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"c\">A</button></div></span></div>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">6</span><span class=\"body\">She lives in ___ old house.\n        <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"b\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">the</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">an</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"c\">a</button></div></span></div>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">7</span><span class=\"body\">Turn ___ at the bank.\n        <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"a\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">left</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">on left</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"c\">to left</button></div></span></div>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">8</span><span class=\"body\">Go ___ the supermarket.\n        <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"a\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">past</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">pass</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"c\">passed</button></div></span></div>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">9</span><span class=\"body\">The café is ___ the corner.\n        <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"a\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">on</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">at</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"c\">in</button></div></span></div>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">10</span><span class=\"body\">Take the first ___ on the right.\n        <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"a\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">turning</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">turn left</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"c\">corner</button></div></span></div>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">11</span><span class=\"body\">___ the button to start.\n        <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"c\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">Presses</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">Pressing</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"c\">Press</button></div></span></div>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">12</span><span class=\"body\">___ smile! It's a serious photo.\n        <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"c\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">No</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">Not</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"c\">Don't</button></div></span></div>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">13</span><span class=\"body\">The opposite of heavy is ___.\n        <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"c\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">short</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">easy</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"c\">light</button></div></span></div>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">14</span><span class=\"body\">The opposite of clean is ___.\n        <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"c\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">ugly</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">noisy</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"c\">dirty</button></div></span></div>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">15</span><span class=\"body\">My flat has a great ___ of the park.\n        <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"b\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">picture</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">view</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"c\">window</button></div></span></div>\n\n      <div class=\"instruction\" style=\"margin-top:26px\">Part 2 &middot; Write the answer &nbsp;<span class=\"qcount\">questions 16&ndash;21</span></div>\n\n      <p class=\"subline\">Type your answer. Spelling counts; capital letters and full stops do not.</p>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">16</span><span class=\"body\">Make it negative: There are some shops.<br><input class=\"gap gap-lg\" data-answer=\"There aren't any shops.\" placeholder=\"Type your answer&hellip;\"></span></div>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">17</span><span class=\"body\">Make a question: There is a bank near here.<br><input class=\"gap gap-lg\" data-answer=\"Is there a bank near here?\" placeholder=\"Type your answer&hellip;\"></span></div>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">18</span><span class=\"body\">Add articles: I have cat. Cat is black.<br><input class=\"gap gap-lg\" data-answer=\"I have a cat. The cat is black.\" placeholder=\"Type your answer&hellip;\"></span></div>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">19</span><span class=\"body\">Ask the way to the cinema.<br><input class=\"gap gap-lg\" data-answer=\"How do I get to the cinema?|Where is the cinema?\" placeholder=\"Type your answer&hellip;\"></span></div>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">20</span><span class=\"body\">Make it negative: Speak Russian.<br><input class=\"gap gap-lg\" data-answer=\"Don't speak Russian.\" placeholder=\"Type your answer&hellip;\"></span></div>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">21</span><span class=\"body\">Fix the mistake: There is many cafés.<br><input class=\"gap gap-lg\" data-answer=\"There are many cafés.\" placeholder=\"Type your answer&hellip;\"></span></div>\n\n      <button class=\"btn btn-primary\" onclick=\"checkReview(this)\" style=\"margin-top:24px\">Check my answers</button>\n      <div class=\"res\"></div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div id=\"reviewResult\" class=\"review-result\"></div>\n  </section>\n"}